				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>This change was made with significant consideration and evaluation. By focusing on a select group of Medicare Advantage plans, we can ensure that the plans we partner with truly support high-quality, patient-centered care.</p><p> </p><p>A growing number of people in our communities are reaching Medicare age, making it especially important for us to have a sustainable, coordinated approach that allows us to provide the seamless and personal care our patients deserve. By focusing on a smaller number of Medicare Advantage partners, we are better positioned to meet the needs of our patients.</p>								</div>
