				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0488d57 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0488d57" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Out-of-network refers to a healthcare provider who does not have a contract with a particular health insurance plan. If you use an out-of-network provider, healthcare services may cost more.</p>								</div>
