				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Choosing a Medicare Advantage plan is a personal decision, and each patient needs to assess their unique health needs. To explore options that are in-network for NCH:</p><ul><li>Visit <strong><a href="https://nchmd.org/patients-and-visitors/contracted-insurance-plans/">Contracted Insurance Plans </a></strong>to find a list of all insurance plans that are in-network for NCH for 2027.</li><li><strong>Contact your insurance broker</strong> and ask them how to maintain in-network access to NCH in 2027.</li></ul>								</div>
